  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>min</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>max</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mi>max</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>i.e. each element of the ordered pair&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will appear either in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;will be sum of all elements of the ordered pair&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1100</mn></math></p>",
